  {
   "shot": "S1",
   "a": 0,
   "b": 64,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 64,
   "line": "That night, for the first time in weeks,"
  },
  {
   "shot": "S2",
   "a": 64,
   "b": 112,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 48,
   "line": "everything feels okay."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S3",
   "a": 112,
   "b": 148,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 36,
   "line": "Mum is asleep."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S4",
   "a": 148,
   "b": 187,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 39,
   "line": "Ellie is asleep."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S5",
   "a": 187,
   "b": 232,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 45,
   "line": "The street is quiet."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S6",
   "a": 232,
   "b": 286,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 54,
   "line": "Then a voice starts."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S7",
   "a": 286,
   "b": 352,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 66,
   "line": "Louder than anything you have ever heard."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S8",
   "a": 352,
   "b": 421,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 69,
   "line": "So loud the glass in the window shakes."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S9",
   "a": 421,
   "b": 514,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 93,
   "line": "Because the more someone is thinking about you, the louder they get."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S10",
   "a": 514,
   "b": 547,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 33,
   "line": "It's Nora."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S11",
   "a": 547,
   "b": 664,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 117,
   "line": "'You thought your head was the only quiet place left, ' she thinks."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S12",
   "a": 664,
   "b": 754,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 90,
   "line": "'It never was. I've heard every thought you've had."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S13",
   "a": 754,
   "b": 826,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 72,
   "line": "I didn't give it away. I gave it to you."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S14",
   "a": 826,
   "b": 889,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 63,
   "line": "And tomorrow, I'm taking it back. '"
  },
  {
   "shot": "S15",
   "a": 889,
   "b": 970,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 81,
   "line": "Then the voice stops. Everything stops."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S16",
   "a": 970,
   "b": 1072,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 102,
   "line": "For the first time since that Monday, you can't hear anyone."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S17",
   "a": 1072,
   "b": 1099,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 27,
   "line": "Not Mum."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S18",
   "a": 1099,
   "b": 1129,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 30,
   "line": "Not Ellie."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S19",
   "a": 1129,
   "b": 1162,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 33,
   "line": "Not the street."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S20",
   "a": 1162,
   "b": 1204,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 42,
   "line": "Just silence."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S21",
   "a": 1204,
   "b": 1339,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 135,
   "line": "And on the other side of the road, under the streetlight, a girl is looking up at your window."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S22",
   "a": 1339,
   "b": 1462,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 123,
   "line": "So why did she give it to you? And what happens when she takes it back?"
  },
  {
   "shot": "S23",
   "a": 1462,
   "b": 1501,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 39,
   "line": "That's for part two."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S24",
   "a": 1501,
   "b": 1588,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 87,
   "line": "Is any of this real? Hearing thoughts, no."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S25",
   "a": 1588,
   "b": 1747,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 159,
   "line": "But people really have thousands of thoughts a day, our minds really wander almost half the time,"
  },
  {
   "shot": "S27",
   "a": 1747,
   "b": 1837,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 90,
   "line": "and brain implants really have started to read inner speech."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S26",
   "a": 1837,
   "b": 2008,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 171,
   "line": "So, would you want to hear everyone's thoughts? Tell me in the comments."
  }
 ],
